        "name": "Generate admin password if empty",
        "description": "Generate admin password if empty",
        "code": "//refAssemblies: TCAdmin.SDK.dll, TCAdmin.GameHosting.SDK.dll, TCAdmin.Scripting.dll, TCAdmin.Monitor.dll\nusing System;\nusing TCAdmin.SDK.Misc.Extensions;\n\nvar Globals = new TCAdmin.Scripting.Engines.Addons.CSharpGameGlobals(); // DO NOT MODIFY THIS LINE\n\nvar current = Globals.ThisService.Variables.Parse\u003Cstring\u003E(\u0022AdminPassword\u0022);\nif (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(current))\n    Globals.ThisService.Variables[\u0022AdminPassword\u0022] = Random.Shared.GetRandomString(12, true, true);\n",
